  "description": "Aggregate several registered services behind one interface for AutoRegisterDependency. Mark an interface with [AggregateService] and declare its members; a Castle proxy resolves them at runtime, so there is no facade class to write. Sync members only. Requires AutoRegisterDependency.Extension.Interception; no own third-party dependencies.",
